/* 荒野与近郊额外遭遇 / 8 条 × 3 段 / 贝壳箭头·倒木铁锅·渠底界石·湖畔雾笛·红绳草药·通风井布条·残骸厨房·石环外圈石子 */

:: MP Wild Extra Events Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Park")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Park">>
<</if>>
猎人小径尽头的告示板上，最近多了一排用炭笔画的简图。画的人显然不擅长写字，箭头、圆圈和几道波浪线代替了地名。守林人说，这些地方都不远，只是没人愿意在雾散之前去看。
<br><br>
你把八张图按方向排开，发现它们分别指着海岸、林子、农田和湖。纸角用不同的绳结系着，有的结朝海，有的结朝山。最旧的一张已经卷边，图上还沾着盐粒。
<br><br>
<<caveicon>><<link [[第二层洞的贝壳箭头 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[倒木圈中央的铁锅 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Log Circle]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[渠底糊泥的界石 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[清晨只响一声的雾笛 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[峭壁上换方向的红绳 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Red Thread Herbs]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[通风井口的多色布条 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Vent Flags]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[残骸厨房里的热汤 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Galley Pot]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<parkicon>><<link [[石环外圈每天换的石子 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Pebble Pattern]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[木牌侧面的巡山速写簿 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Events Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开告示板 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
大潮退到最低的那天，海蚀洞第一层只剩脚踝深的水。你原本只想捡几枚完整的海胆壳，走到洞腹最里侧时，头顶忽然多出一道缝。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 300>>
	你顺着箭头的转折数了一遍：朝里、朝上、朝地，三段方向对应潮水的涨落和两条岔道。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_shell_path"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	你盯着那排贝壳看了很久，只觉得像一条乱线。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿箭头走进深处 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先看被取走的那枚 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows Step2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
洞室往里收窄，最后只剩一条能侧身通过的缝。缝壁上也有贝壳，间隔比外面大，箭头一律朝下。
<br><br>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	你用铜扣的边沿顶住贝壳，顺着凿痕一旋，鸟腹整块弹开。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_shell_niche"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	贝壳在你手里打滑，铜扣弹进碎石缝。你换了个角度硬撬，石板纹丝不动，指甲却劈了一道。<<pain 2>><<stress 5>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<caveicon>><<link [[把油布包抽出来 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows Resolve]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[先听洞外的水声 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows Resolve]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("wild_extra_shell_arrows_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
油布包里是一枚黄铜哨、三枚发黑的旧币和一张折成小块的潮沟图。纸角盖着半个褪色的船锚印，墨已经洇开。你把东西塞进内袋，回头时才发现石坡上的水线变了。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($swimmingskill or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 280>>
	你等到水面回落的那一瞬，蹬住缝壁冲出去，肩膀擦过洞口的岩棱。<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 720>><<elseif _sk gte 380>><<set _reward to 480>><<else>><<set _reward to 300>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你冲得太早。浪头把你推回缝里，后脑撞上岩壁，油布包脱手漂走。<<pain 3>><<stress 6>><<tiredness 2>><<set $mpClues["wild_extra_shell_niche"] to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<beachicon>><<link [[沿礁脊回到沙滩 (0:05)|Beach]]>><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从海岩高处翻回去 (0:04)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Log Circle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
林子深处有一圈倒木。不是风刮倒的，每一棵都朝圆心倒，树根还带着翻起的黑土，断口是斧头砍出来的斜茬。你绕着走了一圈，数出九棵，粗细差不多，倒下的角度也差不多。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 300>>
	你选了一棵最细的倒木，蹬住树根发力，把它挪开半尺。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_log_ring"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	倒木比看上去沉。你推了两次，树身只晃了晃，树根下的土却塌了一块，鞋陷进松针里。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[跨进圈里看铁锅 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Log Circle Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先查石头灶的灰 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Log Circle Step2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Log Circle Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你跨过缺口，脚一落进圈内，林子里的声音就变了。风还在吹，头顶的枝叶却不动，松针也不翻。你走到土包前，锅耳被磨得发亮，内侧有一圈深色的手印。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($skulduggery or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 300>>
	你用锡勺柄撬开锅底补丁的一角，铜片后面是空的。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_log_cache"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	补丁的铆钉比看上去硬。你用力一别，锡勺弯了，铜片却纹丝不动。<<stress 4>><<pain 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[照着树上的刻痕找 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Log Circle Resolve]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[把锅盖原样盖回去 (0:07)|MP Wild Extra Log Circle Resolve]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Log Circle Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("wild_extra_log_circle_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你刚把锅盖放回去，缺口外的松针就响了一声。一个人从倒木背后直起身，肩上挂着一卷绳，手里提着一把短斧。斧刃朝下，没有举起来。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>>
	是 Eden。<</if>>
对方走到灶边，用靴尖拨了拨灰，露出底下没烧透的炭。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 330>>
	你没有提铜片，也没有提树上的刻痕，只说自己在找一条能走回林缘的路。<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><</if>>
	<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 480>><<set _reward to 700>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 500>><<else>><<set _reward to 320>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你把铜片攥得太紧，指节发白。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<set $mpClues["wild_extra_log_cache"] to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿东南近路回林缘 (0:06)|Forest]]>><<pass 6>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<parkicon>><<link [[穿过兽径去公园后门 (0:08)|Park]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[顺林间溪流看踏脚青石 (0:04)|MP Moment Forest 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
:: MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
旱了半个月，农场东边的灌溉渠见了底。渠底的泥裂成一块块翘起的薄片，踩上去会发出脆响。你沿着渠埂走，看见中段被人挖开一道支沟，渠水全拐进了南边的荒地，主渠只剩一层浑汤。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 300>>
	你用麦秸当刷子，一点点刮开泥壳。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_boundary_old"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	泥壳干硬，你刮了几下只掉了一层浮土。指甲缝里塞满泥，字却一个也没认全。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[把整块石头撬起来 (0:07)|MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone Step2]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿支沟走到南边 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你用锄柄撬动青石，石头在泥里转了半圈，露出背面。背面也刻着字，笔画比正面新，凿痕发白，边缘没有风化。两行字之间隔着一道浅浅的竖线，像有人想把旧界划掉，又没敢凿干净。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($history or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 300>>
	你按新旧两组刻痕的间隔推算，旧界往北偏了整整一垄。被挪走的不是石头，是一条水路。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_boundary_moved"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	你盯着那些刻痕，越看越乱。柳枝的绿汁沾在手上，滑得抓不住石头。<<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<set $mpClues["wild_extra_boundary_old"] to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去柳树下问雇工 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone Resolve]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[下到支沟尽头查看 (0:07)|MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone Resolve]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("wild_extra_boundary_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
支沟尽头是一片刚翻过的荒地，土色比农场的地深。地头插着一根细木杆，杆上系着红布，布条的方向和主渠一致。你顺着支沟往回走，柳树下的雇工已经站起来，手里捏着一顶草帽。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>
	麦垛后转出来的是 Alex。<</if>>
对方说这条支沟是三天前开的，因为南边那块荒地今年第一次分到水。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 330>>
	你把拓片摊在渠埂上，先念旧界，再念新界，没有指责任何人。<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</if>>
	<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 480>><<set _reward to 720>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 500>><<else>><<set _reward to 320>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你把话说得太快，指名道姓问是谁挪的石头。柳树下的雇工把草帽往头上一扣，转身就走。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<set $mpClues["wild_extra_boundary_moved"] to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从柳树林绕回森林 (0:07)|Forest]]>><<pass 7>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿渠埂回农场 (0:05)|Farmland]]>><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[去谷仓外看防雨干草垛 (0:04)|MP Moment Farm 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
:: MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "lake_ruin">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
天还没亮透，湖上的雾已经漫到脚踝。你站在废屋外的旧栈桥上，听见雾里响了一声。很低，很长，像有人把一口气吹进一只大螺里。声音从湖心偏北的位置来，响完就散，没有再响第二声。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 320>>
	你闭上眼睛，只听。声音起来时，左耳的震感比右耳重，尾音被水面拉长。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_fog_direction"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	雾里的声音像从四面八方一起挤过来。你转了几次身，每次都觉得自己背对着它。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<swimicon>><<link [[涉水往浅湾去 (0:07)|MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle Step2]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[沿芦苇道摸过去 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "lake_ruin">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
浅湾里漂着一只木排，四只旧油桶把它托出水面。木排中央钉着一只铜管，管口朝北，管身缠着防水的蜡布。铜管下面连着一只踏板风箱，风箱的皮囊被湖水泡得发黑，踏板却擦得很亮。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($skulduggery or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 300>>
	你拆开风箱侧面的木盖，里面不是普通的皮囊，而是一只可以调音的簧片盒。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_fog_device"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	木盖的钉子锈死在木头里。你用力一撬，盖板裂开，风箱皮囊跟着泄了气，发出一声难听的抽响。<<stress 4>><<pain 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[顺着水下细绳摸 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle Resolve]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[留在木排上等天亮 (0:08)|MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle Resolve]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "lake_ruin">><<effects>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("wild_extra_fog_whistle_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
水下细绳的另一头是一只沉在木排下的铁笼，笼里装着几块石头和一只旧气压表。气压表被绳子牵着，水位一变就拉动风箱的连杆。这不是人吹的，是湖水自己在响。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 310>>
	你踩着油桶把铜管重新校回北向，又把簧片盒里垫高的两片归位。<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 480>><<set _reward to 660>><<elseif _sk gte 390>><<set _reward to 460>><<else>><<set _reward to 300>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你踩上油桶时，桶身在湿木上滚了半圈。你伸手去扶铜管，整个人滑进浅湾，冷水没到胸口。<<pain 2>><<stress 6>><<tiredness 3>><<set $mpClues["wild_extra_fog_device"] to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从芦苇荡绕回林边 (0:08)|Forest]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿栈桥回废屋 (0:05)|Lake Ruin]]>><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[顺步道去公园郁金香花圃 (0:04)|MP Moment Park 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
:: MP Wild Extra Red Thread Herbs [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
采药小径贴着峭壁，最窄的地方只放得下两只脚。你背贴岩壁横移过去，海风从下方顶上来，把外套吹得鼓起。转过一道凸岩，眼前忽然多了一丛草。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($tending or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 260>>
	你解开红绳，发现绳结的收口朝着海，绳头却回折向山。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_red_knot"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	绳结比看上去紧。你拉了两下，红绳勒进草茎，几片叶子被扯断。你怕伤到整丛草，只好松手。<<stress 4>><<pain 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿小径继续往前 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Red Thread Herbs Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[下到崖壁凹处查看 (0:07)|MP Wild Extra Red Thread Herbs Step2]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Red Thread Herbs Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
崖壁凹处比小径低半人高，要抓着一截裸露的树根才下得去。凹处背风，地上铺着碎贝壳和干海草，角落里放着一只扁铁盒。盒盖没有锁，只用同样的红绳绕了两圈。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 320>>
	你没有立刻去碰那块岩片，先数了数盒里的干草。三种草，两束治咳，一束止血，都是按用量扎的。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_red_partner"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	你伸手去够岩片，指尖刚碰到，脚底的石子就滑了。<<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<set $mpClues["wild_extra_red_knot"] to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[把岩片推开看看 (0:07)|MP Wild Extra Red Thread Herbs Resolve]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[回小径上等采药人 (0:08)|MP Wild Extra Red Thread Herbs Resolve]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Red Thread Herbs Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<effects>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("wild_extra_red_herbs_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
岩片后面是一条浅洞，只够一个人趴着进去。洞底铺着干海草，海草上有一只翻倒的布包和一只空水壶。布包旁的地面上留着几道抓痕，方向朝外，像有人从这里爬出去过。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>
	你退回小径时，Gwylan 正从崖口那头过来，腰间挂着一把弯头刀，刀柄的布和铁盒里那把一样。<</if>>
对方说绑红绳的是她同伴，前天去北坡采药，说好当天回。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 320>>
	你让 Gwylan 留在凹处收好铁盒，自己贴着岩壁往北坡横移。<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>>
	<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 480>><<set _reward to 700>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 500>><<else>><<set _reward to 340>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你走到一半，海风忽然加大，脚下的石棱被浪打湿。你不敢再往前，只能退回凹处。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<set $mpClues["wild_extra_red_partner"] to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<beachicon>><<link [[沿崖下沙滩离开 (0:07)|Beach]]>><<pass 7>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从礁石坡回海岩 (0:06)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 6>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Vent Flags [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
矿道尽头的通风井比别处凉。井口架着四方木框，框上垂下来一截铁梯，梯级锈得只剩铁芯。井口横梁上挂着一排布条，蓝、白、红，间隔一样，绳结全打在左边。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 300>>
	你把颜色按长短排开，看出这不是随手的晾布：蓝长是安全，白短是有人来，红最短是别下来。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_vent_signal"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	你只看出颜色不同。风一换向，布条绞在一起，长短也乱了。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<caveicon>><<link [[沿铁梯下到井底 (0:07)|MP Wild Extra Vent Flags Step2]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先看井壁的刮痕 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Vent Flags Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Vent Flags Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
井底比井口宽，像一间被掏空的石室。靠墙搭着一张窄床，床上铺着旧麻袋，袋口露出干草。床边是一只铁皮箱，箱盖上压着三块石头，石头下面垫着布，怕响。
石室中央有一张用木箱拼成的小桌。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($skulduggery or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 300>>
	你用剪子尖挑开箱盖的搭扣，里面没有锁，只有一根别住的铁丝。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_vent_hider"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	搭扣比看上去紧。你一用力，剪子尖滑开，划在铁皮上，发出刺耳的声响。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[敲敲铁皮箱说句话 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Vent Flags Resolve]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[先退回铁梯上等着 (0:07)|MP Wild Extra Vent Flags Resolve]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Vent Flags Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("wild_extra_vent_flags_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
铁皮箱的盖子从里面顶开一条缝。一个瘦削的人探出头，头发上沾着煤灰，手背有一道刚结痂的划伤。他看见你，没有喊，先抬头看井口的布条。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 330>>
	你没有动。<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 480>><<set _reward to 640>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 450>><<else>><<set _reward to 300>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你开口太急，声音在石室里撞出回音。井口的人立刻停住，白布被扯下来，换成红布。<<pain 2>><<stress 6>><<set $mpClues["wild_extra_vent_hider"] to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从矿道侧口上麋鹿街 (0:08)|Elk Street]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿林间小路回森林 (0:07)|Forest]]>><<pass 7>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Galley Pot [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pirate_ship">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
海盗船搁在礁石之间，船身朝岸一侧倾斜。你从裂开的舷窗翻进厨房，脚一落地就踩到一层湿沙。舱顶很低，横梁上挂着锅铲和一把缺口的刀，随船身轻轻摆。
厨房中央的砖砌炉灶居然还是温的。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 300>>
	你捞起一片根茎，断面有细密的放射纹，是海边人用来退烧的苦根。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_galley_soup"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	汤味又腥又苦，你闻久了有些反胃。锅底忽然冒起一个大泡，灰汤溅到手背上，烫得你一缩。<<stress 4>><<pain 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿湿脚印去货舱 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Galley Pot Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先看灶膛里的纸 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Galley Pot Step2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Galley Pot Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pirate_ship">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
灶膛里的纸只剩半张，字被火燎掉一边。剩下的一半写着几味草名和分量，最下面一行是：一日两次，不能断。纸背有油渍，像是从一本册子上撕下来的。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($skulduggery or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 300>>
	你用铁丝重新别住货舱门，又检查了病人手腕上的绳结。结是活扣，越挣越紧，但不会勒伤。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_galley_patient"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	你去够货架底层的木匣，脚下一滑，膝盖撞在货架角上。<<pain 2>><<stress 5>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[把汤重新热上 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Galley Pot Resolve]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[藏在货架后等人回来 (0:07)|MP Wild Extra Galley Pot Resolve]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Galley Pot Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pirate_ship">><<effects>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("wild_extra_galley_pot_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你把锅推回灶眼，添了两块干柴。火苗从灶膛里舔上来，汤重新冒起小泡。你按纸上的分量抓了一小把草，放进锅里。苦味慢慢压住了腥味，舱里升起一层白气。
货舱方向传来脚步声。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($tending or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 260>>
	你帮他把汤分进两只罐子，又用布包住烫手的那只。老人端着汤进了货舱，回来时脸色好了些。<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 420>><<set _reward to 620>><<elseif _sk gte 330>><<set _reward to 420>><<else>><<set _reward to 280>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你分汤时手不稳，热汤泼在灶沿，罐子也滑进舱底的窄河。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<set $mpClues["wild_extra_galley_patient"] to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿礁脊回海岩 (0:07)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 7>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<beachicon>><<link [[从船侧跳上沙滩 (0:06)|Beach]]>><<pass 6>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Pebble Pattern [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
森林石环外圈有一片被踩实的空地。你走近时，先看见地上的石子：十几枚大小差不多的白石子，摆成一条折线，折线末端是三个并排的点。石子摆得很正，每枚之间的间隔都差不多，不像风吹的。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($maths or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 260>>
	你把折线按转折点数了一遍：四段，三个点。四点像一条路，三点像三个人。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_pebble_message"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	你盯着石子看了很久，只看出折线和点。风把落叶吹过来，盖住两枚石子。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去看那棵刻记号的桦树 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Pebble Pattern Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[躲起来等摆石子的人 (0:08)|MP Wild Extra Pebble Pattern Step2]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Pebble Pattern Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
桦树的树皮被削掉一小块，露出底下的白木。白木上刻着和地上一样的折线，旁边还有几道更浅的划线，像被反复改过。刻痕里嵌着细土，树根周围散着石子的碎屑。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 300>>
	你把锡片举到光下，认出上面划的是：北边第三个点，等我。字迹很急，最后一笔拖得很长。<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_pebble_note"] to 1>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	锡片太薄，光一照就反白。你换了几个角度，只认出“等”和“水”两个字。<<stress 4>><<set $mpClues["wild_extra_pebble_message"] to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[朝灌木那边出声 (0:06)|MP Wild Extra Pebble Pattern Resolve]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[绕到石环北侧去 (0:07)|MP Wild Extra Pebble Pattern Resolve]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Pebble Pattern Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("wild_extra_pebble_pattern_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
灌木后面走出一个人，手里捧着一把白石子，裤脚沾着溪泥。看见你，那人先看地上的图案，又看你的手，确认石子没有被踢乱，才松了口气。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>
	是 Robin。Robin 把石子放进衣袋，指尖被溪水泡得发白。<</if>>
对方说这些石子是留给一个朋友的。
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 320>>
	你没有劝他回去，也没有说朋友不会来。<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
	<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 460>><<set _reward to 600>><<elseif _sk gte 390>><<set _reward to 420>><<else>><<set _reward to 280>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你说了句“他可能不会来了”。Robin 的手停住，过了一会儿才把石子放回袋里。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<set $mpClues["wild_extra_pebble_note"] to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿林道回森林边缘 (0:06)|Forest]]>><<pass 6>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<parkicon>><<link [[从兽径去公园后门 (0:08)|Park]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
